@baseUrl = http://localhost:8096

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Start / continue a conversation (anonymous session)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "anon-demo-session-1",
  "conversationId": "chat-demo-1",
  "query": "How are you today? Reply with a single short sentence."
}

### Follow-up (same conversation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "anon-demo-session-1",
  "conversationId": "chat-demo-1",
  "query": "What did I ask you earlier? Reply with a single short sentence."
}

### Inspect stored conversation (ownerId = sessionId for anonymous)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations/chat-demo-1?ownerId=anon-demo-session-1

### List conversations for an owner
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations?ownerId=anon-demo-session-1

### Delete a conversation (ownerId required)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations/chat-demo-1?ownerId=anon-demo-session-1

